鄩在莘县久驻缺粮，晋军攻断甬道。", "phases": [], "location_name": "莘县、梁军营寨", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "d655edb9-1dc3-52b6-9660-32d4d390bb23"}, {"title": "朱友贞责刘鄩迟不决战，刘鄩以缺粮和敌强答复", "start_year": 915, "end_year": 915, "time_original": "915年莘县对峙期间；确日未载", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "朱友贞责刘鄩迟不决战，刘鄩以缺粮和敌强答复。", "phases": [], "location_name": "莘县、后梁朝廷", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "27c8b1af-bb33-565c-b82a-dfe58afcb634"}, {"title": "刘鄩反对仓促决战，借河水告诫诸将", "start_year": 915, "end_year": 915, "time_original": "915年梁帝催战后；确日未载", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "刘鄩反对仓促决战，借河水告诫诸将。", "phases": [], "location_name": "刘鄩军营", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "be258278-6f91-58a2-a245-7e5c4c89186d"}, {"title": "刘鄩攻镇定军营遭符存审、李建及反击，大败退寨", "start_year": 915, "end_year": 915, "time_original": "915年梁帝催战数日后；确日未载", "dynasty": "五代十国", "description": "刘鄩攻镇定军营遭符存审、李建及反击，大败退寨。", "phases": [], "location_name": "镇定军营、刘鄩军寨", "location_modern_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_note": "仅保留史载地名；未核坐标。", "status": "draft", "id": "c1940820-960d-566b-bfa4-fa3aea2b3165"}]'::jsonb)
